    "detailed_description": "I want to become a taxi driver and experience everyday life in such an interesting profession.<br><br>One might think that working behind a taxi wheel is a dull and bland task. But you couldn\u2019t be more wrong! In Taxi Simulator you will play as a shady rap driver and drive through the wildly urban areas. Don\u2019t worry too much about your reputation though, as it can be improved later on. You start on the lowest level in the city\u2019s hierarchy. you are just an average cabby. Your task will be obviously to transport people.<br><br>Yet folk that you are going to meet will differ greatly. Starting with ordinary citizens, through party animals, celebrities, and mobs, and ending with prostitutes. After some time you will be king of the streets knowing every single secret and gossip. And you will be rich, like very, very rich.<br><br><strong>Become the best taxi driver in town</strong><br>The rides that you will give will make an impact on your reputation in various social groups. Scoring points with celebrities while transporting them in cozy conditions, or maybe you prefer to become a private driver for the local gang. It\u2019s all up to you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Become the wealthiest cabby in the city</strong><br>Naturally, you take the fare for the rides you have given. You may offer your clients extra services for which they will pay more money. Or maybe you want to haggle?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>It\u2019s your call</strong><br>The client has left his stuffed wallet behind. It\u2019s up to you whether you will call it in, or keep it to yourself...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Tune your ride</strong><br>You can upgrade your ride for the cash you have earned. You can Invest your money into equipment that increases passengers\u2019 comfort or increases the car\u2019s driving characteristics. Even both if that\u2019s your choice.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>How is your day going?</strong><br>One of the taxi driver\u2019s responsibilities is to chat with passengers. You can have a word with everyone and learn many interesting things as well as get to know how are the things in town. Unless you prefer to be silent as a grave...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you are fed up with boring simulators and want to experience the vibrant city, then Taxi Simulator is the perfect game for you!",
    "about_the_game": "I want to become a taxi driver and experience everyday life in such an interesting profession.<br><br>One might think that working behind a taxi wheel is a dull and bland task. But you couldn\u2019t be more wrong! In Taxi Simulator you will play as a shady rap driver and drive through the wildly urban areas. Don\u2019t worry too much about your reputation though, as it can be improved later on. You start on the lowest level in the city\u2019s hierarchy. you are just an average cabby. Your task will be obviously to transport people.<br><br>Yet folk that you are going to meet will differ greatly. Starting with ordinary citizens, through party animals, celebrities, and mobs, and ending with prostitutes. After some time you will be king of the streets knowing every single secret and gossip. And you will be rich, like very, very rich.<br><br><strong>Become the best taxi driver in town</strong><br>The rides that you will give will make an impact on your reputation in various social groups. Scoring points with celebrities while transporting them in cozy conditions, or maybe you prefer to become a private driver for the local gang. It\u2019s all up to you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/4cc87d03a484228f3361a78757476047.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Become the wealthiest cabby in the city</strong><br>Naturally, you take the fare for the rides you have given. You may offer your clients extra services for which they will pay more money. Or maybe you want to haggle?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/7423dc8652b6009073be0fdab003dadd.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>It\u2019s your call</strong><br>The client has left his stuffed wallet behind. It\u2019s up to you whether you will call it in, or keep it to yourself...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/61703a2c5ea400de98bb50edf0fa83ce.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Tune your ride</strong><br>You can upgrade your ride for the cash you have earned. You can Invest your money into equipment that increases passengers\u2019 comfort or increases the car\u2019s driving characteristics. Even both if that\u2019s your choice.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/06d284d4d0b2e8046ae2ac4e0300eb33.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>How is your day going?</strong><br>One of the taxi driver\u2019s responsibilities is to chat with passengers. You can have a word with everyone and learn many interesting things as well as get to know how are the things in town. Unless you prefer to be silent as a grave...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.poster.avif?t=1736253983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.webm?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1159390/extras/35c75bc0750f220eda287256db73063c.mp4?t=1736253983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you are fed up with boring simulators and want to experience the vibrant city, then Taxi Simulator is the perfect game for you!",
